<title>USA: Ultratech Stepper Q3 shr $0.42 vs $0.32.</title>
<headline>Ultratech Stepper Q3 shr $0.42 vs $0.32.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultratech Stepper, Inc.</p>
<p>		(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				  Sep 30,  Sep 30,   Sep 30,  Sep 30,</p>
<p>				     1996     1995	1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		    $46,502  $42,205  $150,008 $110,535</p>
<p> Cost of sales		 21,159   20,083    68,909   53,476</p>
