<p>Note:</p>
<p>All share and per share data have been retroactively restated to reflect a two-for-one stock split distributed in the form of a 100-percent dividend on May 10, 1995.</p>
<p>The Company's third fiscal quarter ended on September 28, 1996 and September 30, 1995.  For convenience of presentation, the Company's financial statements have been shown as ending on September 30, 1996 and September 30,1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
